    "name": "Authentication Routes",
    "description": "It contains manual teating of Authentication routes.\n\n- POST /auth/register : use to register user\n    \n- POST /auth/login : use to login the user\n    \n- POST / auth/send-verification-email : use to send otp to verify email of user\n    \n- POST /auth/verify-email : use to verify email of user based on otp\n    \n- POST /auth/forgot-password : use to send otp to change password\n    \n- POST /auth/reset-password : use to reset password with sent otp\n    \n- POST /auth/refresh : use to get accessToken from refresh token when they got expired\n    \n- PATCH /auth/update-profile-pic : use to update user's profile pic\n    \n- POST /auth/logout : use to logout user",
